<http://data.silknow.org/object/e337d4de-12a3-3464-ba32-c4bad26d6c49/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Girl's cloak of pale puce silk figured with a self-coloured pattern of vertical waving stems and pinnate leaves, and lined with pale turquoise silk.  The cape (which is piped in pale turquoise satin throughout) has a rounded turn-down collar of pale turquoise satin above a double shoulder cape; vertical armhole slits with decorative external flaps; and tying strings of broad pale turquoise ribbon (one missing) at the neck front."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/e337d4de-12a3-3464-ba32-c4bad26d6c49> .

